 Prince Philippos and Princess Nina welcome first child via surrogate]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133716195.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Princess Diana’s godson, Prince Philippos of Greece, and Princess Nina have welcomed their first child, a son named Kimon Thomas Konstantinos. Born via surrogate in the United States on July 27, the baby’s arrival was announced weeks later. His middle names honour Nina’s father Thomas Flohr and Philippos’ late father, Constantine II, Greece’s last king.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/princess-dianas-godson-prince-philippos-and-princess-nina-welcome-first-child-son-kimon-thomas-konstantinos-via-surrogate-in-the-us-nearly-six-years-after-their-wedding/articleshow/133716195.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/princess-dianas-godson-prince-philippos-and-princess-nina-welcome-first-child-son-kimon-thomas-konstantinos-via-surrogate-in-the-us-nearly-six-years-after-their-wedding/articleshow/133716195.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-02T22:23:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133716219,imgsize-107317.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet the 19-year-old who made 7,000 bow ties to help shelter pets find homes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133686071.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-sir-darius-brown-the-19-year-old-who-has-made-7000-bow-ties-for-shelter-pets-and-helped-raise-more-than-500000-to-help-animals-find-homes/articleshow/133686071.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-sir-dar